---
const paths = [
  ['A problem worth solving','Bring us a difficult problem that deserves curiosity, depth, and determination.'],
  ['A collaboration to explore','Work with us to bring the right people and capabilities together.'],
  ['A willingness to build','If you move between ideas and execution, we want to hear what you could contribute.'],
];
---
<div class="co-sub co-careers">
  <section class="co-sub-hero"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-sub-hero-grid"><div><p class="co-kicker">CAREERS &amp; CONTACT</p><h1>Good work starts<br/>with a <em>conversation.</em></h1><p class="co-lead">E Deviser exists to work on difficult problems with people who care about making meaningful progress. If that sounds like the work you want to be part of, let’s start a conversation.</p></div><div class="co-contact-art"><span>OPEN CHANNEL</span><strong>Let’s<br/><em>connect.</em></strong><i>↗</i><small>E DEVİSER / 01</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section"><div class="co-sub-wrap"><p class="co-kicker">WHAT BRINGS YOU HERE?</p><div class="co-sub-heading"><h2>Start with<br/><em>what matters.</em></h2><p>We begin with the problem, understand what makes it difficult, and explore what it would take to move it forward. The best conversations are specific, thoughtful, and open to evidence.</p></div><div class="co-paths">{paths.map((path,i)=><article><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{path[0]}</h3><p>{path[1]}</p></div><b>↗</b></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-sub-tint"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-open"><div><p class="co-kicker">CAREERS</p><h2>Curious enough<br/><em>to question.</em><br/>Practical enough to build.</h2></div><div><p>We value people who challenge assumptions, get close to the details, and stay open to changing their minds when the evidence tells them to. We look for people who do not just ask what is possible, but what is worth doing. Specific vacancies are not listed in the supplied company copy, so we will publish roles only when they are confirmed.</p><a href="/company/team/">Meet the team ↗</a></div></div></section>
  <section class="co-sub-section co-contact" id="contact"><div class="co-sub-wrap co-contact-panel"><div><p class="co-kicker">START A CONVERSATION</p><h2>Tell us what<br/><em>you’re thinking.</em></h2><p>The company copy supplied for this page invites people to talk to E Deviser, but it does not include a verified email address, phone number, or enquiry form destination. We will not publish guessed contact details. Add the approved contact channel here before launch.</p></div><div class="co-contact-status"><span>CONTACT INFORMATION</span><strong>Talk to E Deviser</strong><small>Contact channel to be confirmed before publication.</small><a href="/company/team/">Meet the team ↗</a></div></div></section>
</div>
<style>
.co-sub{--sub-bg:var(--color-surface);--sub-text:var(--brand-navy);--sub-muted:var(--color-text-muted);--sub-line:var(--color-border);background:var(--sub-bg);color:var(--sub-text);overflow:hidden}.co-sub *{box-sizing:border-box}.co-sub-wrap{width:min(88rem,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto}.co-sub-section{padding:clamp(4.5rem,8vw,8rem) 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-sub-tint{background:var(--color-surface-soft)}.co-kicker{margin:0 0 1.5rem;color:var(--text-on-light-link);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:var(--text-xs);font-weight:var(--weight-bold);letter-spacing:var(--tracking-wide);text-transform:uppercase}.co-sub h1,.co-sub h2{margin:1rem 0 1.5rem;font-size: var(--text-h1);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:var(--brand-navy)}.co-sub h1 em,.co-sub h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-sub p{color:var(--sub-muted);line-height:1.8}.co-sub-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,9vw,9rem) 0;background:var(--gradient-pattern-light)}.co-sub-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-lead{max-width:39rem;font-size: var(--text-base)}.co-contact-art{min-height:24rem;position:relative;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;border:1px solid var(--color-border-inverse);background:var(--gradient-dark-luminous);color:var(--brand-white)}.co-contact-art>span,.co-contact-art>small{font:500 .6rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--brand-teal-light)}.co-contact-art strong{font-size: var(--text-display);line-height:1.02;margin:2rem 0}.co-contact-art em{font-style:normal;color:var(--text-on-dark-accent)}.co-contact-art i{position:absolute;right:2rem;bottom:2rem;font-size: var(--text-2xl);color:var(--text-on-dark-accent);font-style:normal}.co-contact-art>small{position:absolute;bottom:1.5rem;left:2rem}.co-sub-heading,.co-open,.co-contact-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .8fr;gap:8vw;align-items:center}.co-sub-heading>p,.co-open>div:last-child{max-width:38rem}.co-paths{margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-paths article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr 2rem;gap:1.2rem;align-items:center;padding:1.5rem .3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-paths article>span{font:600 .75rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-paths h3{font-size: var(--text-xl);margin:0}.co-paths p{margin:.4rem 0 0;font-size: var(--text-sm)}.co-paths article>b{color:var(--text-on-light-link);font-weight:400}.co-open h2,.co-contact-panel h2{font-size: var(--text-h2)}.co-open a,.co-contact-status a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--text-on-light-link);text-decoration:none;font-weight:650;font-size: var(--text-sm)}.co-contact{background:var(--color-surface-soft)}.co-contact-panel{padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--sub-line);background:var(--color-surface-raised);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}.co-contact-status{padding:2rem;border-left:1px solid var(--sub-line)}.co-contact-status span,.co-contact-status small{display:block;font:500 .75rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--text-on-light-link)}.co-contact-status strong{display:block;margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem;font-size: var(--text-xl)}.co-contact-status small{color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.7}
@media(max-width:760px){.co-sub-hero-grid,.co-sub-heading,.co-open,.co-contact-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.co-contact-status{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--sub-line);padding:1.5rem 0 0}.co-sub-wrap{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.co-sub *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style>